  "description": "Built for the sharp end of gravel racing, the all-new Drifter is our fastest and most capable gravel bike yet. With clearance for up to 56mm tires, it delivers unmatched comfort and reduced rolling resistance on rough terrain without compromising speed.\n\nA key to that capability is a 3D-printed titanium chainstay yoke, enabling class-leading tire clearance while preserving generous room for chainrings and heel clearance. Pair that with a suspension-corrected carbon fork, and the Drifter is suspension-ready out of the box, giving you access to greater control and efficiency when you need it most.\n\nEvery Drifter is built to order in our Upstate New York facility, allowing you to tailor fit, drivetrain, cockpit, and more to suit your riding goals. From all-out race days to long-haul gravel adventures, the Drifter is ready.\n\nFULLY BUTTED TUBE SET TO SHAVE GRAMS AND TUNE RIDE QUALITY\n\nCUSTOM MACHINED TITANIUM HEAD TUBES AND HEADSETS FOR PRECISE HANDLING AND A SEAMLESS LOOK\n\nCUSTOM MACHINED TITANIUM HEADSETS COMPLETE WITH ENDURO STAINLESS BEARINGS ARE STANDARD ON ALL FRAMESETS.\n\nCUSTOM MACHINED TITANIUM SEAT TUBE COLLARS ARE STANDARD ON ALL FRAMESETS\n\nUDH 3D SINTERED GRADE 5 SEAMLESS TITANIUM DROPOUTS\n\nLIGHTWEIGHT NO. 6 COMPOSITES CARBON FORK INCREASES TIRE CLEARANCE AND OFFERS SUSPENSION-CORRECTED GEOMETRY\n\nT47 BOTTOM BRACKET FOR MAXIMUM STIFFNESS AND A TIME-TESTED THREADED INTERFACE\n\nA FULL ARRAY OF NO. 22 | PROTOTIPO WORKS BESPOKE HARDWARE",
